From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yi Xie <imxieyi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 14:28:43 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] venus: allow image compression control and the address
 binding report

VK_EXT_image_compression_control, its swapchain companion and
VK_EXT_device_address_binding_report gained an extension index and codecs for
their capability and control structures in the local protocol series. None of
the three defines a command, so a device that offers them is already served by
forwarding the physical device query, and the only thing the renderer withheld
was a place in the allowlist.

The address binding report is a debug-utils messenger callback, and Venus
answers VK_EXT_debug_utils guest-locally, so no report can cross the protocol.
The extension is still worth offering: VP_ANDROID_17_requirements asks for its
presence, and a guest that leaves reportAddressBinding false is a conformant
implementation of it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/venus/vkr_common.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/venus/vkr_common.c b/src/venus/vkr_common.c
index 16c26c7083d41616d00669372cd44c52ea520f39..fc526b6f2877fb983f5cc5d64105ef7138c5671c 100644
--- a/src/venus/vkr_common.c
+++ b/src/venus/vkr_common.c
@@ -161,6 +161,7 @@ static const struct vn_info_extension_table vkr_extension_table = {
    .EXT_depth_clip_enable = true,
    .EXT_depth_range_unrestricted = true,
    .EXT_descriptor_heap = true,
+   .EXT_device_address_binding_report = true,
    .EXT_dynamic_rendering_unused_attachments = true,
    .EXT_extended_dynamic_state3 = true,
    .EXT_external_memory_acquire_unmodified = true,
@@ -171,6 +172,8 @@ static const struct vn_info_extension_table vkr_extension_table = {
    .EXT_global_priority_query = true,
    .EXT_graphics_pipeline_library = true,
    .EXT_image_2d_view_of_3d = true,
+   .EXT_image_compression_control = true,
+   .EXT_image_compression_control_swapchain = true,
    .EXT_image_drm_format_modifier = true,
    .EXT_image_sliced_view_of_3d = true,
    .EXT_image_view_min_lod = true,
